; CONFRM_MMU: Test memory management conformity.
;
; CONFRM with memory management enabled. Every access control field, page
; lengths around the address used, both expansion directions and three
; relocations, on 102 instructions and on the instruction fetch page. The
; checksum also covers SR0, SR2 and the PDR of the page.

MMU = 1
B = 042104
